//! | A header whose magic and version are neither POSIX's (`ustar` and a NUL, any version) nor GNU's (`ustar`, a space, then a space and a NUL), holding an owner name, or, for a device, a device number other than 0 | reads them under those two alone | reads them where the magic begins `ustar` | reads the names and device numbers under any magic, and sets each extracted file's owner from the names | reads them under those two alone | refused ([`UnknownMagic`](crate::ErrorKind::UnknownMagic)). Read where those fields hold nothing, a device's number 0,0 | `headers/an-unknown-magic-with-owner-names`, `headers/a-v7-header-with-owner-names`, `headers/a-character-device-under-gnu-magic-with-another-version` |
