//! | A map ending before the file's real size, with no empty region at it | extracts the file only to the end of the last region, or empty where there is none | extracts it to the real size | extracts it to the real size | extracts it to the real size | refused ([`Sparse`](crate::ErrorKind::Sparse)([`End`](crate::SparseFlaw::End))) | `sparse/an-old-gnu-sparse-file-ending-in-a-hole-without-its-last-region`, `sparse/a-sparse-file-in-pax-format-1.0-ending-in-a-hole-without-its-last-region`, `sparse/a-sparse-file-in-pax-format-1.0-with-no-region`, `sparse/a-sparse-file-in-pax-format-1.0-whose-last-region-is-empty-before-its-end`, `sparse/a-sparse-file-in-pax-format-1.0-whose-count-is-less-than-its-regions` |
